#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/acpid.xml:122
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring acpid"
msgstr "Configurando \"acpid\""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/acpid.xml:125
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>acpid</application> is configured by user defined events.  "
"Place event files under <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/etc/acpi/events</filename> directory. If an event "
"occurs, <command>acpid</command> recurses through the event files in order "
"to see if the regex defined after \"event\" matches. If they do, action is "
"executed."
msgstr ""
"<application>acpid</application> é configurado por eventos definidos pelo(a)"
" usuário(a). Coloque os arquivos de eventos sob o diretório <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/etc/acpi/events</filename>. Se ocorrer um evento, "
"[então] <command>acpid</command> percorre os arquivos de eventos para a "
"finalidade de ver se a expressão regular definida depois de \"event\" "
"corresponde. Se corresponder, [então] a ação é executada."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/acpid.xml:134
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The following brief example will suspend the system when the laptop lid is "
"closed<phrase revision='sysv'> (it requires <xref linkend=\"pm-"
"utils\"/>)</phrase>.  The example also disables the default handling of the "
"lid close event by &logind; when the system is on battery and not connected "
"to any external monitor, in order to avoid a conflict:"
msgstr ""
"O breve exemplo a seguir suspenderá o sistema quando a tampa do laptop for "
"fechada<phrase revision='sysv'> (exige <xref linkend=\"pm-"
"utils\"/>)</phrase>. O exemplo também desabilita o tratamento padrão do "
"evento de fechamento da tampa pelo &logind; quando o sistema estiver "
"funcionando com bateria e não conectado a nenhum monitor externo, para a "
"finalidade de evitar um conflito:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/acpid.xml:142
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/acpi/events/lid &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>event=button/lid\n"
"action=/etc/acpi/lid.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/acpi/lid.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>#!/bin/sh\n"
"/bin/grep -q open /proc/acpi/button/lid/LID/state &amp;&amp; exit 0\n"
"/usr/sbin/pm-suspend</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"chmod +x /etc/acpi/lid.sh\n"
"\n"
"mkdir -pv /etc/elogind/logind.conf.d\n"
"echo <literal>HandleLidSwitch=ignore</literal> &gt; /etc/elogind/logind.conf.d/acpi.conf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/acpi/events/lid &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>event=button/lid\n"
"action=/etc/acpi/lid.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/acpi/lid.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>#!/bin/sh\n"
"/bin/grep -q open /proc/acpi/button/lid/LID/state &amp;&amp; exit 0\n"
"/usr/sbin/pm-suspend</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"chmod +x /etc/acpi/lid.sh\n"
"\n"
"mkdir -pv /etc/elogind/logind.conf.d\n"
"echo <literal>HandleLidSwitch=ignore</literal> &gt; /etc/elogind/logind.conf.d/acpi.conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/acpid.xml:157
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/acpi/events/lid &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>event=button/lid\n"
"action=/etc/acpi/lid.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/acpi/lid.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>#!/bin/sh\n"
"/bin/grep -q open /proc/acpi/button/lid/LID/state &amp;&amp; exit 0\n"
"/usr/bin/systemctl suspend</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"chmod +x /etc/acpi/lid.sh\n"
"\n"
"mkdir -pv /etc/systemd/logind.conf.d\n"
"echo <literal>HandleLidSwitch=ignore</literal> &gt; /etc/systemd/logind.conf.d/acpi.conf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/acpi/events/lid &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>event=button/lid\n"
"action=/etc/acpi/lid.sh</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/acpi/lid.sh &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>#!/bin/sh\n"
"/bin/grep -q open /proc/acpi/button/lid/LID/state &amp;&amp; exit 0\n"
"/usr/bin/systemctl suspend</literal>\n"
"EOF\n"
"chmod +x /etc/acpi/lid.sh\n"
"\n"
"mkdir -pv /etc/systemd/logind.conf.d\n"
"echo <literal>HandleLidSwitch=ignore</literal> &gt; /etc/systemd/logind.conf.d/acpi.conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/acpid.xml:173
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, not every computer labels ACPI events in the same way (for "
"example, the lid may be recognized as <filename>LID0</filename> instead of "
"<filename>LID</filename>).  To determine how your buttons are recognized, "
"use the <command>acpi_listen</command> tool. Also, look in the <filename "
"class=\"directory\">samples</filename> directory under <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/share/doc/acpid-&acpid-version;</filename> for more"
" examples."
msgstr ""
"Infelizmente, nem todos os computadores rotulam os eventos ACPI da mesma "
"maneira (por exemplo, a tampa possivelmente seja reconhecida como "
"<filename>LID0</filename> em vez de <filename>LID</filename>). Para "
"determinar como teus botões são reconhecidos, use a ferramenta "
"<command>acpi_listen</command>. Além disso, procure no diretório <filename "
"class=\"directory\">samples</filename> sob <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/share/doc/acpid-&acpid-version;</filename> para "
"mais exemplos."

