#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To automatically start <command>acpid</command> when the system is rebooted,"
" install the <filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/acpid</filename> boot script from "
"the <xref linkend=\"bootscripts\"/> package."
msgstr ""
